<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-WALES BEAT NETHERLANDS 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES BEAT NETHERLANDS 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BREDA, Netherlands 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat Netherlands</p>
<p>1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer championsnhip</p>
<p>group seven qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Simon Haworth (7)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,809</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Wales		   4   3   0   1   8   2   9</p>
<p> Netherlands	   2   1   0   1   2   1   3</p>
<p> Turkey		  1   1   0   0   2   1   3</p>
<p> Belgium		 2   1   0   1   6   3   3</p>
<p> San Marino	    3   0   0   3   1  12   0</p>
</text>
